From 7d509ef69aa5463d1c58cfd8c125e64d331c2686 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yxin-d <yxin2502@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:13:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Import: skip non-product tabs, keep both items when a
 barcode is reused

Tabs with no product names (Review, Product Report, ...) no longer become
empty categories. When two different products share one barcode in the file,
the later one is imported without the barcode and flagged, instead of
overwriting the first (in this import or on a re-import).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPERamDaxbxzn2kMqyuA1B
