From 69a7604d6ab637d2ff1c6a31049b123fe565de7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yxin-d <yxin2502@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:19:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Product/customer delete, customer edit, credit
 statements, fix blank receipt prints

- Products: delete from the edit pane or in bulk (with confirmation); past
  sales keep their own copy of the name and price
- Customers: edit name/phone/credit limit; delete via delete_customer(),
  which refuses while they owe money and archives (hides, keeps history)
  anyone with credit or sales history; archived filter + restore
- Customer page: print an A4 credit statement (or save as PDF) and download
  it as Excel, for customers who want a copy
- Receipt printing was blank: the print CSS used display:none on every top
  level element, which also hid the receipt inside them. Switched to
  visibility so only the receipt prints, on one page.
- Migration 0002_customer_archive.sql (archived_at, delete_customer, and no
  new credit for archived customers)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPERamDaxbxzn2kMqyuA1B
